H_0014> the functor of groupoids\n<MATH_0015>\nis the restriction (see\nGroupoids, Section <REF_0002>)\nof <MATH_0016> via the map <MATH_0017>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:48f28390f87357f148bfec53fb7331535cf1c893952d4ca8166a81d43a457c98", "unit_id": "tag:044B:statement"}
