{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "044A", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$g : U' \\to U$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$(U', R', s', t', c') \\to (U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0007": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0008": "$U'$", "MATH_0009": "$R' = R|_{U'}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-restrict-groupoid}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-restrict-groupoid}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:00c03fbea05ef8548020ca1f06fb6dd7a33273c663df6ce170ab1d825fe27ff8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:470088143c7569a06686057854386d13007fe3dfa0809fb4a925ff974479f8d0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0005>.\nThe morphism of groupoids in algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0006>\nconstructed in Lemma <REF_0002> is called\nthe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>restriction of <MATH_0007> to <MATH_0008><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>.\nWe sometime use the notation <MATH_0009> in this case.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4372784d995cf16f7cee8fb4b770f9d9d7b4642605837b69b238463931dd66dd", "unit_id": "tag:044C:statement"}
